@startuml
!pragma charset UTF-8
title Member Design, Review and Consultation Flow
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FCF9F8
  BorderColor #807663
  ArrowColor #5B5E67
}

|Member|
start
:Open saved design or design-request workspace;
if (Consultation?) then (yes)
  :Start context-linked or general consultation;
  |Staff|
  :Handle conversation within assigned location scope;
  |Manager|
  :Handle conversation with global operational scope;
  :Exchange immutable UTF-8 messages;
  |Member|
  :Close conversation or continue;
  |Staff or Manager|
  :Close or reopen conversation;
  |Member|
  :Hide only a closed conversation from own sidebar;
else (Custom request)
  :Submit description/images/design snapshot;
  |System|
  :Validate ownership, consent and image quality;
  :Set NEED_REVIEW;
  |Staff or Manager|
  :Review request;
  :Record decision and mandatory explanation;
  |Member|
  :Read result or submit clarification;
  if (Accepted?) then (yes)
    |Staff or Manager|
    :Prepare quote;
    |Manager|
    :Approve quote;
    |Member|
    :Pay full amount before expiry;
    |System|
    :Verify payment;
    |Staff or Manager|
    :Produce and fulfil custom order;
  endif
endif
stop

note right
Member-only business chat; Guest sees the entry point but must sign in.
Feature-012 design is an optional reference and remains independent from booking.
An accepted design request continues only through quote, full payment and fulfilment.
end note
@enduml
